r15-fixtures-judge run 3 (2026-10-07, exit 0), kept as -run3 with its script and the pairs it judged (r15-edits/tgc-1-run3.pairs).
It judged the first candidate kernel (r15-edits/kernel-1-run1.pairs), whose code-span reading made every character of a
code span inert; the adopted candidate keeps letters and digits there (see r15-measure-run1.note). One positive row was
added in both passes for the letter-keeping (a code-span word before a label word, which a renderer shows as that word),
and the judge of record follows on the adopted candidate.
